# Rung 1 of docs/zfpga.md sec. 5.3: a bitstream that loads and does
# nothing. No cells at all -- just nextpnr's baseline, which zfpga pnr
# always applies. On a board: DONE goes high, nothing else happens.
# That tests the packer, the IDCODE and the CRCs end to end, and only
# those.
#
#   zfpga pnr empty.zn && zfpga pack empty.config -c

device LFE5U-25F
package CABGA256
